claimed here. All point values, coefficient norm witnesses, derivative bound and
sharp ellipse/weighted-power inequalities are kernel checked. The shared
exponential lower bound E<exp(65*C) is Arb-checked only in this pilot; it will need
its own generic soundness/numeric kernel proof before production. -/

